	(text "H1-H4: M3 NON-plated mounting holes (no copper).\nCentred on the 56 mm board edge (half-hole notches), one per quadrant\nbetween the outer white pair (docs/plan.md 6.4). Non-plated keeps\nthe board eligible for JLCPCB Economic assembly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "55bdf9aa-edf1-5d37-9a96-dea4a05364ac")
	)
	(text "USB-C power-only sink (5 V, up to 3 A).\nR1/R2 = 5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2 -> any Type-C source supplies 5 V.\nCC1/CC2 also go to XIAO ADC pins so firmware can read the source's\nadvertised current (Default 0.25-0.61 V, 1.5 A 0.70-1.16 V, 3 A 1.31-2.04 V)\nand limit LED brightness to match. Shield tied to GND.\nD1 feeds the XIAO 5V pin and blocks the programming PC's VBUS\nfrom back-feeding the LED rail (Seeed-recommended)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e3a4b363-7008-527c-9b69-493da2a8f181")
	)
